Retribution negates half of all damage you take while it is active. Once Retribution has negated [249, 335, 402, 458, 508 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage, your shield will explode in a burst of light, inflicting damage equal to the amount negated in a radius of [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] and deactivating the talent.

The amount absorbed will increase with your Spellpower.
